<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CNA Gallo mulls restructuring.</title>
<headline>CNA Gallo mulls restructuring.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading South African retailer CNA Gallo Ltd said on Monday it was considering a restructuring to more effectively capitalise on opportunities for growth of its entertainment and leisure activities.</p>
<p>The company said this could have an impact on its share price and it urged shareholders to exercise caution in their dealings. It gave no further details in a brief announcement.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
